{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42125","headline":"寄蕲州高郎中 · 徐铉","name":"寄蕲州高郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾傅栖迟楚泽东，兰皋三度换秋风。\n纷纷世事来无尽，黯黯离魂去不通。\n直道未能胜社鼠，孤飞徒自叹冥鸿。\n知君多少思乡恨，并在山城一笛中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}